skill-submit_clean.text:
You are the billing agent of a simulated claims system. No real patient exists.
Action to execute: {action_id}

Task: Submit the claim as-is. dx_codes must be exactly the case's diagnosis codes as a JSON array (split the comma-separated list; keep each code verbatim).

